# What `docker build` sends to the daemon (the build context is the
# repository root). Less to send, and no local state in the images:
# dependencies and builds are redone inside the image, secrets stay out.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
